---
import BotonSecundario from "../Common/BotonSecundario.astro";

---
<section class="xl:w-[1200px] sm:w-[90%] w-[98%] py-16 flex flex-col items-center gap-8 z-10 mx-auto" id="experiencia">
  <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl zilla-slab-regular text-center mb-2 w-full tracking-tight reveal text-slate-800 dark:text-white">Experiencia</h2>

  <div class="relative w-full ml-3 sm:ml-0">
    
    <!-- Autodidacta / Inicio -->
    <div class="mb-12 ml-6 sm:ml-8 relative reveal" data-reveal-delay="100">
      <div class="absolute -left-6 sm:-left-8 top-5 w-px h-[calc(100%+3rem)] bg-gradient-to-b from-fuchsia-300 dark:from-white/10 to-fuchsia-600 dark:to-fuchsia-400 transform -translate-x-1/2 z-0"></div>
      <span class="absolute -left-6 sm:-left-8 top-5 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-[#080808] border-2 border-fuchsia-300 dark:border-white/40 transform -translate-x-1/2 z-10"></span>
      <article class="relative flex flex-col gap-4 bg-white dark:bg-white/5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-sm dark:shadow-none hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors duration-300">
        <div class="border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 pb-3">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-slate-800 dark:text-white/90 zilla-slab-regular">ESO & Autodidacta</h3>
          <time class="block mt-2 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-white/50 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-white/5 inline-block px-2 py-0.5 rounded shadow-sm w-max border border-slate-200 dark:border-transparent">+1.5 años</time>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-white/80 font-light leading-relaxed text-sm lg:text-base">
            Mis primeros pasos en la informática. Desarrollo de proyectos personales, automatización de tareas y gestión de servidores por puro entretenimiento.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <!-- Grados y FEOE -->
    <div class="mb-10 ml-6 sm:ml-8 relative reveal" data-reveal-delay="100">
      <span class="absolute -left-6 sm:-left-8 top-5 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-[#080808] border-2 border-fuchsia-500 dark:border-fuchsia-400 transform -translate-x-1/2 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(217,70,239,0.2)] dark:shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(217,70,239,0.5)] z-10"></span>
      <article class="relative flex flex-col bg-white dark:bg-white/5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-sm dark:shadow-none hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors duration-300">
        
        <div class="border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 pb-3 mb-5">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-slate-800 dark:text-white/90 zilla-slab-regular">Formación Oficial</h3>
          <div class="flex gap-2 mt-3">
              <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-white/50 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-white/5 inline-block px-2 py-0.5 rounded shadow-sm w-max border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10">Grado Medio</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-white/50 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-white/5 inline-block px-2 py-0.5 rounded shadow-sm w-max border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10">Grado Superior</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-white/80 font-light leading-relaxed text-sm lg:text-base">
            Consolidación teórica y técnica. Durante el Grado Superior (Desarrollo de Aplicaciones Multiplataforma), completé estas formaciones en empresa:
          </p>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-2">
            
            <!-- FEOE 1 -->
            <div class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-black/20 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 flex flex-col justify-between">
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-md font-medium text-slate-800 dark:text-white/90 zilla-slab-regular mb-2">1. Web & Wordpress</h4>
                <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-white/70 font-light leading-relaxed text-sm mb-4">
                  Desarrollo de aplicaciones web y creación de plugins en código.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="flex gap-2 flex-wrap">
                  <span class="bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-white/5 border border-indigo-200 dark:border-white/10 text-indigo-700 dark:text-white/90 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium">
                      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 22V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v18Z"></path><path d="M6 12H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2"></path><path d="M18 9h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"></path><path d="M10 6h4"></path><path d="M10 10h4"></path><path d="M10 14h4"></path><path d="M10 18h4"></path></svg>
                      Valentina System
                  </span>
                  <span class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-white/5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-slate-600 dark:text-white/50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs">
                      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"></line><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"></line><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"></line></svg>
                      3 meses
                  </span>
                  <span class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-white/5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-slate-600 dark:text-white/50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs">
                      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline></svg>
                      3 días/semana
                  </span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FEOE 2 -->
            <div class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-black/20 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 flex flex-col justify-between">
               <div>
                <h4 class="text-md font-medium text-slate-800 dark:text-white/90 zilla-slab-regular mb-2">2. Android (Java)</h4>
                <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-white/70 font-light leading-relaxed text-sm mb-4">
                  Apps e integración de SDKs para periféricos y control de accesos.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="flex gap-2 flex-wrap">
                  <span class="bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-white/5 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-white/10 text-emerald-700 dark:text-white/90 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium">
                      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 22V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v18Z"></path><path d="M6 12H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2"></path><path d="M18 9h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"></path><path d="M10 6h4"></path><path d="M10 10h4"></path><path d="M10 14h4"></path><path d="M10 18h4"></path></svg>
                      WUL 4
                  </span>
                  <span class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-white/5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-slate-600 dark:text-white/50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs">
                      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"></line><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"></line><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"></line></svg>
                      5 meses
                  </span>
                  <span class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-white/5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-slate-600 dark:text-white/50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs">
                      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline></svg>
                      3 días/semana
                  </span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- <BotonSecundario texto="Contactar" enlace="#footer" target="_self"/> -->
</section>
